ecided to try my hand at something I'd never really got working before in Acrobat. Calculations! I played around abit, and it looks like I have them working. The Character Sheet has some calculations based on attributes and such. The Record sheet has some calculations for experience based on checking some boxes(meaning when you check a box, it adds a number to the total) and the session sheet has a calc for GM experience.<br /> <br /> It's my first time doing something with calculations, and I think they turned out pretty good.<br /> <br /> Heres the links:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_CharacterSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_CharacterSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_CharacterSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_CharacterSheet_Interactive.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_RecordSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_RecordSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/Do