heets. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/btp.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/btp.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Collection of Character Sheets created by MrGone. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Granted, they aren't interactive yet as I was still waiting on some info from OP...but I posted what I have so far. I'll work on the Interactive version when I get the chance.<br /> <br /> Hope you like em...so far anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T23:43:03-08:00","id":773685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=773544#post773544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have the sheets up now:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/btp.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/img/logo-main.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/btp.html\" target=\"_blank\"> MrGone's Character Sheets. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/btp.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/btp.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Collection of Character Sheets created by MrGone. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Granted, they aren't interactive yet as I was still waiting on some info from OP...but I posted what I have so far. I'll work on the Interactive version when I get the chance.<br /> <br /> Hope you like em...so far anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow. Those are very impressive. I love the spot for Satiety Conditions, and that there's plenty of room to record the details of any Kinship Nightmares you develop (on the 4-page, anyway - it's all I ever use). Having a spot for Family Ties is definitely a must for Beasts too, since they aren't the ones that get a condition to represent it. This is an awesome sheet.<br /> <br /> I don't think the part for Breaking Points is necessary, though - Beasts don't have them. That section could be replaced with a section where one can describe their Beast's Horror, or possibly their Lair? Both of those have to be described during character creation. You could actually cannibalize the expanded Experiences section right next to it as well and you'd have a good spot to describe each of them, side by side.<br /> <br /> If you went that route, I'd change the part of the header for 'Soul' into 'Lesson' - if there's a large portion of the sheet dedicated to describing the Soul / Horror, it'd be good to have a place to record the basic idea of the Lesson the Beast chooses to teach, which for most can be summed up in a small phrase, not unlike character concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3570,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","user":"lnodiv","date":". 11-25-2015, 02:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T04:35:25-08:00","id":773821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=773685#post773685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow. Those are very impressive. I love the spot for Satiety Conditions, and that there's plenty of room to record the details of any Kinship Nightmares you develop (on the 4-page, anyway - it's all I ever use). Having a spot for Family Ties is definitely a must for Beasts too, since they aren't the ones that get a condition to represent it. This is an awesome sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Glad you liked how it turned out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=773685#post773685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think the part for Breaking Points is necessary, though - Beasts don't have them. That section could be replaced with a section where one can describe their Beast's Horror, or possibly their Lair? Both of those have to be described during character creation. You could actually cannibalize the expanded Experiences section right next to it as well and you'd have a good spot to describe each of them, side by side.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm...heres what weird. I made the sheet to the specs that OP gave me. They said everything was good. Hmm...<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll think about your suggestions and maybe do up an &quot;unofficial&quot; version. Probably be a good idea.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=773685#post773685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you went that route, I'd change the part of the header for 'Soul' into 'Lesson' - if there's a large portion of the sheet dedicated to describing the Soul / Horror, it'd be good to have a place to record the basic idea of the Lesson the Beast chooses to teach, which for most can be summed up in a small phrase, not unlike character concept.</div> </div> </div> </div>So on page 1, at the top, you'd want it to be &quot;Soul/Lesson&quot;? Or you'd want a section for soul lesson? You mentioned turning the Breaking Points and experiences into Horror and Lair, so where would you want this?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T08:42:44-08:00","id":774001,"title":"","content":"Weird, I got the character sheet, lair sheet, and side characters sheet with my backer package.<br /> <br /> I'm trying to figure out what to replace Breaking Points with, but all I can think of is an expanded section for Nightmares and Atavisms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T10:58:35-08:00","id":774127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=773821#post773821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmmm...heres what weird. I made the sheet to the specs that OP gave me. They said everything was good. Hmm...<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll think about your suggestions and maybe do up an &quot;unofficial&quot; version. Probably be a good idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bYeah..I don't know. Beast's definitely don't have breaking points.<br /> <br /> Basically, I was thinking that if you do have an expanded section on page 2 to describe the Beast's Soul / Horror, it'd redundant to also have a brief spot in the header for it, and that could be replaced with a spot to describe their Lesson.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=774001#post774001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weird, I got the character sheet, lair sheet, and side characters sheet with my backer package.<br /> <br /> I'm trying to figure out what to replace Breaking Points with, but all I can think of is an expanded section for Nightmares and Atavisms.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it's in a separate PDF that explains a lot - I only threw the corebooks on the flash drive I'm using, and it never occured to me to double check if there were more pdfs. In hindsight it makes sense - I know vampire 2E had the sheets listed seperately too.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Yep, definitely in a seperate PDF. I didn't throw it in my sheets folder because I only use the interactive ones, but <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Sorry for the extra work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3570,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","user":"lnodiv","date":". 11-25-2015, 02:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-29T13:54:30-08:00","id":776783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=774001#post774001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weird, I got the character sheet, lair sheet, and side characters sheet with my backer package.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah...ok. Thanks for the heads up. Glad to hear they included it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=774001#post774001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying to figure out what to replace Breaking Points with, but all I can think of is an expanded section for Nightmares and Atavisms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. I'll we'll see what we can come up with then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=774127#post774127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bYeah..I don't know. Beast's definitely don't have breaking points.</div> </div> </div> </div>Weird they'd let me include that. I looked back through my notes and they didn't specifically ask me to include that, but since I didn't have much to go on I guess I threw it in. I'm surprised they didn't have me ditch it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=774127#post774127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically, I was thinking that if you do have an expanded section on page 2 to describe the Beast's Soul / Horror, it'd redundant to also have a brief spot in the header for it, and that could be replaced with a spot to describe their Lesson.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok cool. Well, I'll see what I can do then. Thanks for the help!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T17:13:53-08:00","id":777438,"title":"","content":"Hey, Inodiv, this was posted in another thread about the Beast sheets:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Speaking of, the current version adds the Beast's lair in dots to the Horror's attributes, on top of simply being the best of the beast's 3 in that category, so it might be nice to have a section to note down your horror's stats separately from your normal ones.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> and when asked a bit about it: <i>&quot;It needs it's own health track. It's possible to injure the horror and not the beast, and vice-versa.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-02T18:34:17-08:00","id":778733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=777438#post777438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, Inodiv, this was posted in another thread about the Beast sheets:<br /> <br /> <i>&amp;quot;Speaking of, the current version adds the Beast's lair in dots to the Horror's attributes, on top of simply being the best of the beast's 3 in that category, so it might be nice to have a section to note down your horror's stats separately from your normal ones.&amp;quot;</i><br /> <br /> and when asked a bit about it: <i>&amp;quot;It needs it's own health track. It's possible to injure the horror and not the beast, and vice-versa.&amp;quot;</i><br /> <br /> Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I mean that's all true. The thing about the horror is that mechanically, it is a distinct entity. It's the kind of thing I almost think a separate sheet might be better for, if you're going to keep track of its health etc.<br /> <br /> That said, I haven't had any cause to do so in the past five sessions I've run. Generally the appearance of the horror has come up a lot because it acts kind of like a mage's nimbus when they use their powers.<br /> <br /> Health only comes up if your horror is engaging in combat without you which is relatively rare. Its attributes come up slightly more frequently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-03T04:32:01-08:00","id":778916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=778733#post778733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I mean that's all true. The thing about the horror is that mechanically, it is a distinct entity. It's the kind of thing I almost think a separate sheet might be better for, if you're going to keep track of its health etc.<br /> <br /> That said, I haven't had any cause to do so in the past five sessions I've run. Generally the appearance of the horror has come up a lot because it acts kind of like a mage's nimbus when they use their powers.<br /> <br /> Health only comes up if your horror is engaging in combat without you which is relatively rare. Its attributes come up slightly more frequently.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, ok. I was just wondering. I'll have to think on it then. Maybe just a small section to write things up, like we were talking about before. Then maybe a separate sheet can be thought up and worked on later...<br /> <br /> Have to see I guess...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T13:34:29-08:00","id":784956,"title":"","content":"Since OP has re-branded the NWoD into Chronicles I made new sheets! Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-b