row-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">:Let me think on it a bit, and see what I can come up with for suggestions.</div> </div> </div> </div>That works.<br /> <br /> Let me ask you this though...what if I ditched Charms on the 2 page sheet entirely? I could then add some specialties on page 1(maybe along with merits), and then add more merits on page 2, along with some other stuff...<br /> <br /> I'd considered maybe moving weapons,armor and health to page 2....but I don't know...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 01-29-2016, 08:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T17:28:24-08:00","id":819603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819554#post819554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That works.<br /> <br /> Let me ask you this though...what if I ditched Charms on the 2 page sheet entirely? I could then add some specialties on page 1(maybe along with merits), and then add more merits on page 2, along with some other stuff...<br /> <br /> I'd considered maybe moving weapons,armor and health to page 2....but I don't know...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd keep the armor/weapons and health on page 1, they're all highly referenced items. At least the main weapon/armor set, there might be some use in alternate weapons on page 2.<br /> <br /> For the charms... I'd probably look at a page 3. The problem with the exalted charms is you tend to need a LOT of space to document the effects, and you start with 12 and generally only get a new one every other session. You might also want to add an ability column to it, since they're all ability specific.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T18:17:39-08:00","id":819619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819603#post819603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd keep the armor/weapons and health on page 1, they're all highly referenced items. At least the main weapon/armor set, there might be some use in alternate weapons on page 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea...I had a feeling that'd be the case. Ah well...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819603#post819603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the charms... I'd probably look at a page 3. The problem with the exalted charms is you tend to need a LOT of space to document the effects, and you start with 12 and generally only get a new one every other session.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I have a stand alone Charms page for people to use...then they can print as many as they need. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819603#post819603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You might also want to add an ability column to it, since they're all ability specific.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wish OP had asked for that when I first made the sheet. Basically have to rebuild the whole charms page to add that...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T13:09:18-08:00","id":819935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819619#post819619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I have a stand alone Charms page for people to use...then they can print as many as they need. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Wish OP had asked for that when I first made the sheet. Basically have to rebuild the whole charms page to add that...<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>On charms once charm cards get going hopefully it should lessen the need to record them on the sheet itself, so at that point making them all on an option page would be good IMO.<br /> <br /> on specializations, it's less of an issue than it sounds. Everyone has at least 3 placed as they see fit, but *generally* they only reflect an area of intense focus in an ability (Bureaucracy -specialized in Trade Deals for example), with only one big exception (Lore) although there might be some people that put 2 against one ability (Melee Swords and Spears for example). <br /> <br /> Lore is a bit of a special case due to a special ability with it. Anyone with Lore 3+ and a specialization can try to &quot;introduce a fact&quot; related to that specialization. So if you were meeting with the assassins of Dethal to cut a deal , and you happened to have something like &quot;Dethal Customs&quot; you could roll and try to introduce the fact that &quot;Dethal have a tradition of hospitality and respect for tradition, one of which is the offering of a haunch of a food animal at the start of a negotiation shows great respect and admiration.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T16:22:04-08:00","id":820636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819935#post819935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On charms once charm cards get going hopefully it should lessen the need to record them on the sheet itself, so at that point making them all on an option page would be good IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thats cool...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=819935#post819935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">on specializations, it's less of an issue than it sounds. Everyone has at least 3 placed as they see fit, but *generally* they only reflect an area of intense focus in an ability (Bureaucracy -specialized in Trade Deals for example), with only one big exception (Lore) although there might be some people that put 2 against one ability (Melee Swords and Spears for example).<br /> <br /> Lore is a bit of a special case due to a special ability with it. Anyone with Lore 3+ and a specialization can try to &quot;introduce a fact&quot; related to that specialization. So if you were meeting with the assassins of Dethal to cut a deal , and you happened to have something like &quot;Dethal Customs&quot; you could roll and try to introduce the fact that &quot;Dethal have a tradition of hospitality and respect for tradition, one of which is the offering of a haunch of a food animal at the start of a negotiation shows great respect and admiration.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the info. Sounds complicated.<br /> <br /> Well, let me ask this. How big a deal are merits? Were I to take one of the existing merits columns and make it specialties, would there be enough spaces for merits for a typical character?<br /> <br /> <br /> See how this looks to you: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Exalted/Exalted3rdED_2-Pagev2_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 01-31-2016, 08:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T09:06:07-08:00","id":821031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=820636#post820636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, thats cool...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks for the info. Sounds complicated.<br /> <br /> Well, let me ask this. How big a deal are merits? Were I to take one of the existing merits columns and make it specialties, would there be enough spaces for merits for a typical character?<br /> <br /> <br /> See how this looks to you: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Exalted/Exalted3rdED_2-Pagev2_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a></div> </div> </div> </div>That works, merits are basically your backgrounds, so a lot of times you end up taking them and making a note but they're either things that don't frequently come up (I happen to know some people in the arms trade) or are very key to the character that you're unlikely to forget (yeah, I have wings, deal with it). That's why I'd suggest having them on page 2 for the most part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T17:16:20-08:00","id":821311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=821031#post821031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That works, merits are basically your backgrounds, so a lot of times you end up taking them and making a note but they're either things that don't frequently come up (I happen to know some people in the arms trade) or are very key to the character that you're unlikely to forget (yeah, I have wings, deal with it). That's why I'd suggest having them on page 2 for the most part.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah...ok. I wasn't sure exactly how they were used for this. Well, sounds like losing a column isn't a big deal then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Hopefully that one will work for a bit then... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-28T17:00:46-08:00","id":838869,"title":"","content":"Getting ready to work on some M20