o extra Bruised levels, so... would you mind tweaking one of the sheets to add some more health boxes and maybe bring the attributes to 6 dots? Artificially enchanced characters have the weirdest traits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13673-maris-streck","name":"Maris Streck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13673_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-08T04:16:00-08:00","id":1166052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1165798#post1165798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, let me start by saying how useful your work has been to me and my friends. Interactive character sheets are by fare more convenient than anything else for a party that can't easily meet in the same room; so, thank you!</div> </div> </div> </div>You're very welcome! Glad to hear you like my work. I appreciate you using my character sheets!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1165798#post1165798\" rel=\"nofollow\" titl