avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-09T12:54:16-07:00","id":1451476,"title":"","content":"Hi everyone! I wanted to let you know that I finished another little project of mine and I now have Clan branded character sheets for Vampire the Requiem 2nd Edition! I also made a few of my standard type of Add-on sheets as well.<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download them from site in the CoD/Requiem section: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/cofd.html#requiem\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/cofd.html#requiem</a><br /> <br /> <br /> I hope you enjoy em!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 06-09-2021, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T07:18:42-07:00","id":1453548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1440591#post1440591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi everyone! Recently I've been working with a Patron on a slightly redesigned character sheet for Scion 2nd ED (also making it 4 pages) for them to use in their game.<br /> <br /> I have the sheet finished, so I thought I'd share!<br /> <br /> <br /> It's on my site under the Scion section, but here is a direct link: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Scion/ScionHero_2ndED_Redesign_4-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Hope you like it! Enjoy!</div> </div> </div> </div>Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> ! I like the new sheet for <b>Scion</b> 2E - only there is one, but rather big mistake - Paths are 3 different types: <b><i>Origin</i></b>,<b><i> Role</i></b> and <b><i>Pantheon</i></b>, not 3 times Origin. It was a bit confusing for my players when using the new sheet to create characters.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UdO2BP0.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-26-2021, 10:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-26T20:01:09-07:00","id":1453620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1453548#post1453548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> ! I like the new sheet for <b>Scion</b> 2E - only there is one, but rather big mistake - Paths are 3 different types: <b><i>Origin</i></b>,<b><i> Role</i></b> and <b><i>Pantheon</i></b>, not 3 times Origin. It was a bit confusing for my players when using the new sheet to create characters.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UdO2BP0.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>Hey! Glad you liked it! For that particular sheet, that's how the person requested that section to look.<br /> <br /> But, shortly there after I made an alternate sheet with Role and Pantheon, which I have listed on my site.<br /> <br /> Here's a link for you though: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Scion/ScionHero_2ndED_Redesignv2_4-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http: