th.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T12:11:13-08:00","id":1529331,"title":"","content":"Hello once again everyone! Per a recent Patreon request I now have a custom Dhampir Sheet for Vampire the Masquerade and Hunter the Reckoning 5th Edition that is a bit of a hybrid between the two. I thought it seemed like a pretty interesting concept, so I thought I'd share the finished sheet!<br /> <br /> <br /> I have versions in the Minimalist, Classic and Requiem styles! I hope you like how they turned out!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download them in the V5 section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#v5\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#v5</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-26T17:54:44-08:00","id":1529530,"title":"","content":"Hi!<br /> I noticed that when you re-apply dots or other traits in some (or all) of the sheets, they lose their original font and are replaced with Arial (which makes the dots look smaller).<br /> I was hoping there is a way around it? other than being extremely careful not to untick anything accidentally..<br /> I hope I'm not asking something you're already tired of hearing, I went through the FAQ in your website but I couldn't find anything about it.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance, and thank you for the awesome sheets!<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3mzE4U1.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25177-lirbo","name":"Lirbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25177_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-27T05:35:41-08:00","id":1529545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lirbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1529530#post1529530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi!<br /> I noticed that when you re-apply dots or other traits in some (or all) of the sheets, they lose their original font and are replaced with Arial (which makes the dots look smaller).<br /> I was hoping there is a way around it? other than being extremely careful not to untick anything accidentally..<br /> I hope I'm not asking something you're already tired of hearing, I went through the FAQ in your website but I couldn't find anything about it.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance, and thank you for the awesome sheets!<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3mzE4U1.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/3mzE4U1.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/3mzE4U1.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hello! Sorry for the issue. I have heard of this before(but not too often actually), so it might not be a bad idea to include in the FAQ.<br /> <br /> Assuming you're using Acrobat, the issue comes in with the Form Highlighting. Why that affects it is beyond me though. But, if you turn that off, it should display normally. And that option is located by clicking on Preferences(either under Menu, or Edit, depending on your version), going to the Forms section and then Unchecking 'Show Border Hover Color for Fields'.<br /> <br /> Hope that helps!<br /> <br /> <img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1447_1706362445072_421\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1447\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1447\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1447&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 01-27-2024, 07:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-10T08:04:21-08:00","id":1530446,"title":"","content":"Hi everyone! I just wanted to let you know that I now have some Kindred of the East 20th Anniversary Style Dharma Branded Character Sheets! I thought since I'd made the color versions of the Kindred of the East sheets that I needed some Dharma branded sheets to go with them.<br /> <br /> <br /> I hope you like how they turned out!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download them in the KotE section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#kote\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#kote</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/