les\" target=\"_blank\">Gen Con</a> based on the video game Vampire the Masquerade: Bloodlines. He needed a 5th Edition sheet in the Bloodlines style, but then he was thinking he would like some sheets based more on the system of the video game, but that could be used for 5th Edition and V20/Revised.<br /> <br /> <br /> So, I revamped my 5th Edition sheet to be more in the Bloodlines style, and then I set about making two sheets that were based on the Bloodlines system, but that had elements from V5 and V20. And of course they needed to be printable.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm really happy with how these sheets turned out, so I hope you like them!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download from my site in the V5 section or the Bloodlines Section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#vtm\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#vtm</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> And if you want to check out this events at Gen Con, here is a link: <a href=\"https://www.gencon.com/events?c=indy2024&amp;search=bloodlines%20tales\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.gencon.com/events?c=indy...dlines%20tales</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> If you need some direct links to the sheets, you can get them here:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_Bloodlines_4-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_Bloodlines_4-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_Bloodlines_4-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V