 class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1547848#post1547848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hey! I don't think I have a sheet for that currently, but if you don't mind, send me an email to <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#eb86998c84858e818e8f828085828c839fab8c868a8287c5888486\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"3e534c5951505b545b5a5755505759564a7e59535f5752105d5153\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> and I'll add it to my to-do list for you. Just let me know what you'd like to see on the sheet and I'll see what I can do. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Just something I noticed. I saw you had a, &quot;Mortals&quot;, theme, one, but, it just doesn't fit in with M:tA(with humanity etc.), and fits in more with V:tM. And quite honestly, I don't know if I'd ever use a Sleeper-sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T12:37:01-08:00","id":1547983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1547967#post1547967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just something I noticed. I saw you had a, &quot;Mortals&quot;, theme, one, but, it just doesn't fit in with M:tA(with humanity etc.), and fits in more with V:tM. And quite honestly, I don't know if I'd ever use a Sleeper-sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey! Yea, I have several different mortal sheets, so it's possible I might have one that would fit a little better. So, if nothing else one of those might work for you if you don't think you'd use a Sleeper sheet.<br /> <br /> If you change your mind though, just let me know and we'll see what we can do. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://f