1553379,"title":"","content":"Hi again everyone! I just wanted to let you know that I now have a Mini Foldable Character Sheet for Vampire the Masquerade: Laws of the Night 5th Edition! When I visited the Darkness Emergent event last year, a kind soul gave me the idea to do a foldable character sheet. I've been working on this on and off for about a year between projects, but was never super happy with the layout. But, I finally had a week or so to really concentrate on it, and I think I finally made something usable!<br /> <br /> <br /> So, if you play Laws of the Night, I hope you get some good use out of this should you get the chance to use it!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download the new sheet in the By Night Studios section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#met\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#met</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Here is a direct link should you need it: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/MET/METBNS/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_LawsOfTheNight_Mini_Foldable.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/MET/METBNS/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_LawsOfTheNight_Mini_Foldable.pd f</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-29T12:52:20-07:00","id":1553547,"title":"","content":"Hi again everyone! After I released my Vampire the Masquerade: Laws of the Night Mini Foldable sheets, I had someone from By Night Studios reach out and ask if I could work on a new project that was along the lines of the mini sheet. The idea was to make a 2 page sheet, with 4 panels each, that you would print double sided that you could then cut to make 4 mini sheets for &quot;quick characters&quot;. This sheet has just the basics (attributes, skills, health, willpower, humanity and disciplines) and could be used for both NPCs and Players for those who are new or just want to jump in quick.<br /> <br /> <br /> So, I've made two versions, one is more for NPCs and the other is more for Players, the only difference being a slight change in layout where the NPC version has a limited skills list while the player version has the full skill list. These sheets could be used for both Laws of the Night or a regular V5 game.<br /> <br /> <br /> I think these turned out pretty cool, so I hope you like them!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download the new sheets in the V5 (Minimalist) section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#vtm\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#vtm</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date"