dition to hosting the book, I'd make some character sheets to go with it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> You can download the new sheets and the booklet from my site in the VtR 2nd Edition section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/cofd.html#requiem\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/cofd.html#requiem</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-23T07:03:12-07:00","id":1560162,"title":"","content":"Hello again everyone! I just wanted to let you know that I made some character sheets for Ugo Le\u00e3o to go with his new Storyteller Vault book '<a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/en/product/568723/v5-v20-vampire-blood-and-tragedy&amp;affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: Blood and Tragedy</a>'!<br /> <br /> <br /> I think they turned out pretty good, so I hope you like them! The book looks really nice too, so hopefully you check it out!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download the new sheets in the V20 and V5 sections of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#vtm\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#vtm</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-29T20:36:48-07:00","id":1560260,"title":"","content":"I might be butchering your mortal character-sheets; I was thinking of using them for NPCs, but, in the abilities-area, only showing the abilities they have as a kinda contrast to a regular, player-character. It will save space. I'm basically thinking about making out a few grogs and companions for Dark-Ages: Mage, in Ars Magic-fashion. Yeah, I don't want to use Ars Magica.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-30T05:25:37-07:00","id":1560269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1560260#post1560260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I might be butchering your mortal character-sheets; I was thinking of using them for NPCs, but, in the abilities-area, only showing the abilities they have as a kinda contrast to a regular, player-character. It will save space. I'm basically thinking about making out a few grogs and companions for Dark-Ages: Mage, in Ars Magic-fashion. Yeah, I don't want to use Ars Magica.</div> </div> </div> </div>Feel free to make any changes you need, assuming you want to try to edit them.<br /> <br /> I do have several types of NPC sheets, but I don't think I have any specifically made for Dark Ages Mage though. And I guess I don't have any NPC sheets for the Dark Ages line, for whatever reason.<br /> <br /> If you don't mind a V20 look, this NPC sheet might be of some use, if you're looking for something simple: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V20/V20_NPCSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/p...nteractive.pdf</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-03T15:37:12-07:00","id":1560327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35750-mrgone-s-character-sheets?p=1560269#post1560269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Feel free to make any changes you need, assuming you want to try to edit them.<br /> <br /> I do have several types of NPC sheets, but I don't think I have any specifically made for Dark Ages Mage though. And I guess I don't have any NPC sheets for the Dark Ages line, for whatever reason.<br /> <br /> If you don't mind a V20 look, this NPC sheet might be of some use, if you're looking for something simple: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V20/V20_NPCSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/p...nteractive.pdf</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Yup; that's what I was thinking; My first NPC-sheet I used for V:tM were the sheets from Street-Fighter! Least I got <i>some </i>use out of that book! <br /> <br /> It's been a long while since I fiddled around with .PDFs (since I was working at a law-firm and had to modify court-forms).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-03T19:05:26-07:00","id":1560331,"title":"","content":"I loved Street Fighter, Mortal Kombat, Tekken and similar games back in the day.<br /> <br /> In fact I still do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-04T04:31:44-07:00","id":1560336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div